{"qid": "tt_t3_00004", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "legalgate", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 1031.18, "n_tokens": 219, "u": 0.352541, "tau_b": 1.0, "tau": null, "channel": "A", "gate_source": "neural_signal", "router_mode": "hybrid", "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["担保法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.36, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 329, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['担保法'] tvc=0", "answer": "不能继续引用《担保法》作为现行有效法律依据。\n\n《中华人民共和国担保法》已于2020年5月28日由《中华人民共和国民法典》施行后废止。根据《民法典》第一千二百六十条，民法典自2021年1月1日起施行，同时废止包括《担保法》在内的多部法律。\n\n因此：\n- 2021年1月1日之后发生的担保相关法律事实，应引用《民法典》相关规定，主要是物权编第四分编“担保物权”、合同编第二分编典型合同中“保证合同”等。\n- 若案件事实发生在2021年1月1日之前，可能涉及法律溯及力问题，需结合《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力的若干规定》判断，但也不宜简单表述为“现行《担保法》”。\n\n所以，作为现行法引用：不可以。作为历史法律或旧法适用问题讨论：可以，", "trace": {"channel": "A", "u": 0.352541, "u_signal": 0.352541, "u_complexity": 0.3, "gate_source": "neural_signal", "router_mode": "hybrid", "complexity_features": {"long": 0.0, "case_word": 0.0, "topic": 0.0, "multi_turn": 0.0, "compare": 0.1, "boilerplate_penalty": -0.0, "category_prior": 0.2}, "tau_b": 1.0, "bucket": "b2", "slots": {"law_short": "担保法", "article_no": null, "paragraph_no": null, "item_no": null, "case_no_raw": null, "topic": null, "temporal_query": false, "law_validity_query": false, "provision_seeking": false, "inherited": []}, "slots_inherited": [], "validity_status": null, "case_verify": null, "source_url": null, "decision": "[neural_signal] u=0.3525 <= tau_b2=1.0 → A", "latency_ms": 1031.1, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "signal": "margin", "k_draft": 20, "intent": {"hit_provision": false, "hit_case_no": false, "slots_complete": false, "route_b_reason": "", "slots": {"law_short": "担保法", "article_no": null, "paragraph_no": null, "item_no