{"qid": "tt_t3_00028", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "legalgate", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 3.98, "n_tokens": 220, "u": 0.364197, "tau_b": 1.0, "tau": null, "channel": "A", "gate_source": "neural_signal", "router_mode": "hybrid", "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["继承法"], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.4, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 330, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['继承法'] tvc=0", "answer": "《继承法》已于2021年1月1日被《民法典》施行后废止，不能再作为现行有效法律引用。\n\n如果对方仍以《继承法》说事，你可以指出：\n\n1. **法律依据已变更**：原《继承法》的内容已被并入《中华人民共和国民法典》第六编“继承”。\n2. **应引用《民法典》**：涉及继承问题，应引用《民法典》第六编相关条文，例如法定继承、遗嘱继承、遗产处理等规定。\n3. **旧法并非当然无效**：如果案件事实发生在2021年1月1日之前，且当时法律有不同规定，可能涉及法律溯及力问题，需要结合《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力的若干规定》判断。\n\n所以，**一般不能再把《继承法》当作现行法引用**；但如果争议涉及民法典施行前的法律事实，则要具体看时间效", "trace": {"channel": "A", "u": 0.364197, "u_signal": 0.364197, "u_complexity": 0.3, "gate_source": "neural_signal", "router_mode": "hybrid", "complexity_features": {"long": 0.0, "case_word": 0.0, "topic": 0.0, "multi_turn": 0.0, "compare": 0.1, "boilerplate_penalty": -0.0, "category_prior": 0.2}, "tau_b": 1.0, "bucket": "b2", "slots": {"law_short": "继承法", "article_no": null, "paragraph_no": null, "item_no": null, "case_no_raw": null, "topic": null, "temporal_query": false, "law_validity_query": false, "provision_seeking": false, "inherited": []}, "slots_inherited": [], "validity_status": null, "case_verify": null, "source_url": null, "decision": "[neural_signal] u=0.3642 <= tau_b2=1.0 → A", "latency_ms": 3.9, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "signal": "margin", "k_draft": 20, "intent": {"hit_provision": false, "hit_case_no": false, "slots_complete": false, "route_b_reason": "", "slots": {"law_short": "继承法", "article_no": null, "paragraph_no": null, "item_no": nul